.next/
# The mocks-OFF build for the multi-instance rehearsal (docs/rehearsal.md).
# Separate from .next/ because NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_MOCKS is inlined at build time
# and the hermetic Playwright suite must keep its mocks-on build intact.
.next-live/
# Throwaway mocks-ON build for verification runs, so a running `next dev` keeps its own .next/.
.next-verify/
out/
test-results/
playwright-report/
next-env.d.ts.bak
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*.local
